88
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:16,633
Tuan Besar Ma, Pengawas Xie

89
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:17,500
Kalian sudah datang

90
00:02:18,366 --> 00:02:19,300
Mereka tidak beristirahat?

91
00:02:19,500 --> 00:02:20,533
Begitu pertempuran kemarin pecah

92
00:02:20,566 --> 00:02:21,400
aku sudah menduga

93
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:22,466
