188
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:33,166
Pasukan perisai, bersiap!

189
00:07:54,533 --> 00:07:55,766
Amunisi unta terbatas.

190
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:56,933
Tidak akan bertahan lama.

191
00:07:57,566 --> 00:07:58,900
Asal bertahan melewati gelombang ini

192
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,066
