Inspektur Patroli Yang, Granat Tangan sudah menipis!

197
00:08:56,033 --> 00:08:57,300
Kalian pakai batang kayu gulir sebisa mungkin

198
00:09:50,933 --> 00:09:52,200
Rumah runtuh masih bisa dibangun lagi

199
00:09:52,466 --> 00:09:54,000
Kalau kota jatuh, orang-orang akan mati

200
00:09:56,633 --> 00:09:57,666
Angkat ke atas tembok kota

201
00:09:57,700 --> 00:09:58,200
Cepat!

202
00:10:24,133 --> 00:10:25,500
Pergi ke anggota pasukan khusus yang melindungiku

203
00:10:26,233 --> 00:10:27,633
Siapkan aku Busur Silang Qinghe

204
00:10:27,666 --> 00:10:28,700
Sebilah pisau pendek

205
00:10:30,333 --> 00:10:31,100
Cepat pergi

206
00:10:49,933 --> 00:10:52,066
Barikade pintunya dengan karung pasir!

207
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,966
Tembok kota sudah jebol!

208
00:11:14,433 --> 00:11:16,766
Hanya Gerbang Utara yang belum terkepung!

209
00:11:16,866 --> 00:11:19,000
Itu satu-satunya jalan keluar bagi seluruh kota!

210
00:11:30,366 --> 00:11:32,133
Buka gerbangnya! Buka gerbangnya!

211
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,833
Kasihanilah, biarkan anak ini keluar!

212
00:11:34,233 --> 00:11:34,933
Biarkan dia hidup

213
00:11:37,066 --> 00:11:37,400
Buka

214
00:11:37,766 --> 00:11:38,633
