215
00:11:38,833 --> 00:11:40,733
Begitu gerbang terbuka, jalan hidup pun ada

216
00:11:40,766 --> 00:11:42,333
Tapi semangat yang menopang pasukan bertahan

217
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,566
