218
00:11:44,866 --> 00:11:45,466
Tuan Zhao

219
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:46,933
Nyonya Chen menitipkan pesan untuk Anda

220
00:11:46,966 --> 00:11:47,266
Dia bilang

221
00:11:47,633 --> 00:11:48,300
Langit mau hujan

222
00:11:48,333 --> 00:11:48,933
Ibu mau menikah

223
00:11:48,966 --> 00:11:49,833
Buka pintunya!

224
00:11:52,233 --> 00:11:52,666
Buka!

225
00:12:08,966 --> 00:12:10,200
Nona, Gerbang Utara sudah terbuka!

226
00:12:10,233 --> 00:12:11,500
Ayo kita kabur dari sana!

227
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,966
Kamu pergi saja, cepat pergi!

228
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:17,833
Jangan pedulikan aku!

229
00:12:17,966 --> 00:12:18,233
Kak

230
00:12:18,266 --> 00:12:19,100
Aku tidak akan pergi

231
